ectivity\n# Feature description: Interaction between Wilderness_Hydrology_Connectivity and Soil_Type_Main_Presence, weighted by Hillshade_Mean.\n# Usefulness: Integrates hydrology-soil connectivity within wilderness zones with illumination conditions for more nuanced classification.\n\ndf['Wilderness_Forest_Connectivity'] = df['Wilderness_Hydrology_Connectivity'] * df['Soil_Type_Main_Presence'] * df['Hillshade_Mean']", "df.drop(columns=['Adjusted_Slope_Impact', 'Elevation_Terrain_Ratio'], inplace=True)\n\n# Dropped columns rationale:\n# Adjusted_Slope_Impact and Elevation_Terrain_Ratio were removed because they introduced extreme values (infinity and NaN), which destabilize models. Transformation complexity doesn't justify their computational impact or real-world interpretability."]
