# Wilderness_Slope_Gradient
# Feature description: Product of Slope and Is_Wilderness_1_Or_2. Combining slope with the wilderness area can capture terrain difficulty within historically important regions.
# Usefulness: This emphasizes the impact of slope variation specifically for wilderness areas 1 and 2, where cover type prediction may highly depend on slope.

