e_Impact_Dense_Areas': 'Feature description: Product of Soil_Type_Specific_Impact and Wilderness_Density_Depth, emphasizing soil-specific impacts in densely forested wilderness zones.', 'Elevation_Mean_Wilderness_Z': 'Z-score normalization of Elevation grouped by Wilderness Area, capturing localized elevation variation for classification.', 'Fire_Road_Weighted_Interaction': 'Interaction feature combining Fire_Road_Proximity_Ratio and Roadways_Normalized_Hillshade_Impact.', 'Hydrology_Ratio_Elevation_Adjusted': 'Ratio of Elevation_Normalized_Hydrology_Ratio to Elevation, adjusted for topography and water distance.', 'Wilderness_Area_Main_Impact_ZScore': 'Z-score normalization of Wilderness_Area_Main_Impact relative to terrain factors like slope or elevation.', 'Adjusted_Elevated_Road_Fire_Ratio': 'Ratio of Elevated_Road_Fire_Proximity to Hydrology_Distance_Ratio, capturing proximity impacts in higher terrain zones.', 'Slope_Hillshade_Cosine_Interaction': 'Product of cosine of Aspect and Slope adjusted by Hillshade_Mean.', 'Wilderness_Density_Normalized': 'Normalize Wilderness_Density_Depth by Slope to capture accessibility in dense wilderness zones.', 'Hydrology_Fire_Road_Impact_Percentage': 'Percentage impact of Hydrology_Fire_Road_Weighted_Sum relative to the mean.', 'Wilderness_Hydrology_Impact_Density': 'Product of Wilderness_Hydrology_Connectivity and Wilderness_Density_Depth, emphasizing dense regions with hydrology connectivity.', 'Roadway_Hydrology_Normalized_Proximity': 'Normalize Roadways_Proximity_ZScore with Hydrology_Proximity_Impact for combined accessibility adjustment.', 'Interaction_Terrain_Slope_Forest': 'Feature description: This feature captures impact of slope variation in relation to the presence of specific soil types, which can affect water retention and forest cover distribution.', 'Hydrology_Slope_Percentage_Impact': 'Feature description: Percent interaction between Slope and Hydrology_Distance_Ratio.', 'Adjusted_Hillshade_Impact_Slope_Normalized': 'Feature description: Ratio of Hillshade_Brightness_Weighted_Slope with Slope_Normalized_Hydrology_Distance.', 'Road_Forest_Cover_Impact': 'Feature description: Interaction between Roadways_Normalized_Hillshade_Impact and Soil_Type_Main_Presence, highlighting the influence of human accessibility on forest cover.', 'Wilderness_Hydrology_Ratio': 'Feature description: Ratio of Wilderness_Density_Depth and Hydrology_Fire_Road_Weighted_Sum.', 'Soil_Type_Proximity_Intensity': 'Feature description: Product of Fire_Road_Weighted_Proximity and Soil_Type_Sum.', 'Normalized_Forest_Hillshade': 'Feature description: Z-score normalization of Hillshade_Mean across all wilderness zones.', 'Soil_Type_Hydrology_Directionality': 'Feature description: Ratio of Adjusted_Elevated_Road_Fire_Ratio to Soil_Type_Specific_Impact.', 'Elevation_Forest_Shade_Interaction': 'Feature description: Product of Elevation_ZScore and Hillshade_Range.', 'Proximity_Road_Wilderness_Impact': 'Feature description: Ratio of Horizontal_Distance_To_Roadways and Wilderness_Hydrology_Impact_Density.', 'Dense_Wilderness_Slope_Directionality': 'Feature description: Combination of Wilderness_Density_Normalized and Slope_Hillshade_Cosine_Interaction.'}
